{{PageBanner|Clb_l_017_en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular shonen anime known as '''Baki Hanma''' (範馬刃牙, ''Baki Hanma'', '''Hanma Baki''') was originally held from March 27th, 2025 to April 10th, 2025. The collaboration includes an exclusive Rare Gacha, exclusive Event Gacha, stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The anime is published by [[wikipedia:Netflix|Netflix]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Baki Hanma'''}} x The Battle Cats collab on now!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 26th, 2025 (11:00AM) until June 9th, 2025 (10:59AM)!'''}}<br>

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Baki Collab Capsules on now!'''}}<br>
Baki Collab Capsules appear in a limited capsule set for a limited time only! Collect collab-limited units such as {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Baki Hanma'''}} and {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Retsu Kaioh'''}}, and others in a special set including:<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Baki Hanma (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Young Champion of the Underground Arena who has won many fierce battles.<br>
Area attacks may Knockback Aku and Pierce Shields.<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Retsu Kaioh (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Fighter who gained the title of Kaioh, the highest mark in Chinese martial arts.<br>
Behemoth Slayer, Strong vs. and may Stop Red and Aliens with area attacks.<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
The second head of the Hanayama Group, known as Japan's greatest brawler.<br>
Tough vs. and deals Massive damage to Aku wth area attacks. Pierces Shields.<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Katsumi Orochi (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Adopted son of Doppo Orochi who inherited Shinshinkai as its young leader.<br>
Pierces Aku Barriers and deals Massive damage to Red and Aliens with area attacks!<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''Jack Hammer (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Baki's half-brother who'll do whatever it takes to gain strength.<br>
Metal Killer, Strong vs. Zombies and Metal enemies, Omnistrikes have 100% chance to Weaken!

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Ogre Cat (Super Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks may Knockback and Slow Aliens.

※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance to appear from Rare Capsule draws during this event.<br>
※ Please be aware that you are not guaranteed to receive an Uber Rare-level unit when drawing from this set.<br>
※ If the Baki capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stages Added!'''}}<br>
Challenge the strongest things alive!<br>
Collab stages featuring the most powerful characters in the Baki universe awaits you!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages to take on these challenges during the collab event!

※If the collab stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Map "Strongest Things Alive"'''}}<br>
Earn {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Legendary Dumbbells'''}} by clearing event stages to earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''special collab units'''}} from the limited Baki Event Capsules!<br>
Legendary Dumbbells have a higher chance of dropping from later stages in the event!

※The number of and chance to receive Legendary Dumbbells increases as you advance to more difficult stages.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Five Gauntlet Stages to test your mettle!'''}}<br>
Challenge the oncoming wave of the strongest things alive! Dive into the world of underground brawling in these special collab Gauntlet Stages!

1st day of collab (May 26, 11:00AM)<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Collab stage: Vs Kaoru Hanayama'''}}<br>
2nd day of collab (May 27, 11:00AM)<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Collab stage: Vs Katsumi Orochi'''}}<br>
5th day of collab (May 30, 11:00AM)<br>
{{Color|#134F5C|'''Collab stage: Vs Retsu Kaioh'''}}<br>
7th day of collab (June 1, 11:00AM)<br>
{{Color|#4EA72E|'''Collab stage: Vs Jack Hammer'''}}<br>
9th day of collab (June 3, 11:00AM)<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Collab stage: Vs Baki Hanma'''}}

Clearing these stages will earn XP and items to make strengthening Cats and clearing stages even easier! Rise above the strongest things alive and ascend to even higher levels of power!

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・New Arena of Honor stage "The Strongest Things"!'''}}<br>
The strongest things alive appear to test your might as the Catclaw Dojo hosts a limited-time collab event!<br>
Navigate to the Catclaw Dojo to access the Arena of Power stage "{{Color|#0000FF|'''The Strongest Things'''}}" to take on the challenge!

Can you get a high score that makes it into the top 10% of Cat Battlers as you pit your score against players from around the world? ?<br>
Once the event is over, your score will earn you awesome rewards depending on what rank you have earned! The higher the tier you reach, the bigger and better the payoff!<br>
Check out what you might get by tapping the Rewards List button at the top right of the Dojo menu screen!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Limited Collab Capsules featuring powerful, muscular units are available! The catch... it costs dumbbells to use!

Visit the Event Capsules from the Cat Base to access the {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Baki Collab Capsules'''}} and collect limited Special units like {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Baki Cat, Kaioh Cat, and Doppo Cat'''}}, or other awesome rewards including XP and useful battle items!<br>
Earn Legendary Dumbbells and try your hand at these limited-time Capsules to earn yourself unique collab-exclusive characters!

※ Baki Event Capsules can only be used with Legendary Dumbbells collected from collab event stages.<br>
※ Collab event stages will only be available during the collab and and Legendary Dumbbells collected will be removed once the collab event ends.<br>
※ Legendary Dumbbells left over at the campaign's end cannot be exchanged for items, XP, etc.<br>
※ If the Baki Event Capsules do not appear as scheduled, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Special Limited-time Missions!'''}}<br>
Baki Collab Event Missions are available at the Missions Tab in the Cat Base!<br>
Clear them all and claim their rewards before the event ends!

※Cleared Mission rewards cannot be claimed after the collab event ends on June 9th, 2025 (10:59AM)

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Login every day during the event to earn items!'''}}<br>
Login every day during the collab event to earn a heap of item rewards, and limited Special unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Li'l Baki'''}} on day 5!

※ Li'l Baki can be activated at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a log-in bonus.<br>
※ Up to 14 days worth of log-in rewards can be collected during this collab event.

For more on Baki, visit the official website:<br>
